<!-- Material Symbols Outlined "gallery_thumbnail" (960x960 grid), used as Library's own topic icon
     in its header — same role Icons.Outlined.SettingsApplications plays in the Settings root
     header, and same "real Material-Symbols-derived path data" approach as ic_undo.xml, rather
     than a raster asset. Fetched from google/material-design-icons' own source SVG, whose
     viewBox="0 -960 960 960" convention (origin at bottom-left of a y-up 960 square, standard for
     Material Symbols) doesn't match Android's vector drawable coordinate space (origin top-left,
     y-down, no viewBox min-y offset support) — translateY="960" shifts the whole coordinate space
     by that same 960 rather than hand-editing every absolute y-coordinate in the path data itself,
     which would have meant separately transforming only the absolute (uppercase-command) values
     while leaving relative (lowercase-command) deltas untouched, an easy place to introduce a
     silent, hard-to-spot shape error. -->
